iiuen2-smooth-share-button-interaction.summary:
The page is a plain white 864x1080 canvas. A small segmented control sits fixed at bottom centre (275,936, 314x68): a light-grey track with a raised white "Send works" segment on the left and grey "Send fails" text on the right. It does not change for the whole clip. At 0.1s the only other thing on screen is a dark #262626 pill button, "Share" with an upload icon, centred at 360,410 (144x55). At about 0.25s a click morphs the pill into a large white share sheet: a 602x705 card at 131,85 with roughly 40px corners and a wide soft grey drop shadow, fully formed by 0.6s. The pill grows and turns white as it expands, and the sheet's contents slide and blur into focus. Top to bottom the sheet holds:
- a title, Share “Q3 launch plan”, with an × close icon on the right;
- a grey rounded panel with the link "northwind.example/d/q3-launch..." and a white pill "Copy" button, above an access row ("Anyone at Northwind" / "Can view and comment", a building icon and a chevron);
- three outlined pill buttons: Email (purple envelope), Slack (colour logo) and X;
- a hairline divider, a "Send to" label and the grey placeholder "Pick people below";
- a row of five 64px round photo avatars (Emma, Marcus, Jasmine, Daniel, Chloe) with grey names;
- a full-width disabled grey "Send" pill.

The cursor clicks Copy at about 1.7s and it becomes a green "✓ Copied" until about 3.3s, then returns to "Copy". The cursor then picks Marcus (about 3.4s), Jasmine (about 4.4s) and Chloe (about 5.4s). Each picked avatar gets a 2px purple ring and a purple check badge, and its name turns black. A small copy of the avatar flies up into a grey chip ("avatar Name ×") in the Send to row, replacing the placeholder. The Send pill turns black and reads "Send to 1 person", then 2, then 3 people. A click at about 6.4s turns it into "◌ Sending" with a spinner. From 7.75 to 8.0s the sheet morphs, with a blurred crossfade, into a smaller 476x338 success card at 194,268. It shows three overlapping avatar photos with a green check badge, "Sent to Marcus, / Jasmine, and 1 other", the grey line "Anyone at Northwind · can view and comment", and a white "Undo" pill beside a black "Done" pill. At about 9.2s Done is clicked. From 9.35 to 9.6s the card shrinks and darkens back into the original Share pill at 360,410, which holds to the end.
